  "text": {
    "name": "Kyoto Protocol",
    "rules": "Record \"targets set\". Each side chooses: Commit to the targets? Then draw from the Contingency deck of the side that played this card. If LIO says yes, (if the result is 3 or more, LIO spends 1 point), then until the end of this turn, points spent by LIO count 1 less, never below 1. If SAE says yes, (if the result is 3 or more, SAE spends 1 point), then until the end of this turn, points spent by SAE count 1 less, never below 1.",
    "history": "The Kyoto Protocol was adopted on 11 December 1997 and entered into force on 16 February 2005; the United States signed it in 1998 but never ratified it.",
